{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方紫色竖线旁的两行白色加粗大字，位置靠上、字号最大、亮度突出。随后中部和下部两块同样醒目的白色大字也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一阵高兴之后，他又开始渴望对方给出一个永远不变的保证。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"渴望确定、缺乏安全感、隐约不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他害怕有一天对方不再需要自己，所以想把已经流露的喜欢藏回去；但他其实是真心想对对方好，重新隐藏感情反而让自己更难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的白色大字争夺主视线，第一块之后缺少明显的主次区分。\",\n    \"第一块句子较长，包含高兴、贪心、渴望承诺、明知无法永远等多个层次，快速扫视不容易同时拿到。\",\n    \"核心情绪的完整含义分散在几块里，需要结合中部和下部文字才能理解他为什么想收回喜欢、为什么又舍不得收回。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "49aa6524-1d2c-4c96-9235-741502e2ea24", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030939019354Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:10:17.039286+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "39ddf8fbb97f39a86449c1e131c9fad89db68957aade0991c514eb3e40354b68", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f